#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.slope.rst:2
msgid "qfeval\\_functions.functions.slope"
msgstr "qfeval\\_functions.functions.slope"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:1
msgid "Compute the slope of linear regression between two tensors."
msgstr "2つのテンソル間の線形回帰の傾きを計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:3
msgid ""
"This function computes the slope coefficient (beta) of the linear "
"regression line that best fits the relationship between tensors :attr:`x`"
" and :attr:`y`. The slope represents the rate of change in :attr:`y` with"
" respect to changes in :attr:`x`, providing insight into the linear "
"relationship between variables."
msgstr "この関数は、テンソル :attr:`x` と :attr:`y` の関係を最もよく表す線形回帰直線の傾き係数 (ベータ) を計算します。傾きは、:attr:`x` の変化に対する :attr:`y` の変化率を表し、変数間の線形関係に関する洞察を提供します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:8
msgid "The slope is calculated using the least squares method:"
msgstr "傾きは最小二乗法を用いて計算されます："

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:10
msgid ""
"\\beta = \\frac{\\text{Cov}(x, y)}{\\text{Var}(x)} = \\frac{\\sum (x_i - "
"\\bar{x})(y_i - \\bar{y})}{\\sum (x_i - \\bar{x})^2}\n"
"\n"
msgstr "\\beta = \\frac{\\text{共分散}(x, y)}{\\text{分散}(x)} = \\frac{\\sum (x_i - \\bar{x})(y_i - \\bar{y})}{\\sum (x_i - \\bar{x})^2}\n\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:13
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\bar{x}` and :math:`\\bar{y}` are the means of :attr:`x` "
"and :attr:`y` respectively."
msgstr "ここで :math:`\\bar{x}` と :math:`\\bar{y}` はそれぞれ :attr:`x` と :attr:`y` の平均値である。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.slope.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:16
msgid "The independent variable tensor. Must have the same shape as :attr:`y`."
msgstr "独立変数テンソル。 :attr:`y`と同じ形状である必要があります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:19
msgid "The dependent variable tensor. Must have the same shape as :attr:`x`."
msgstr "従属変数テンソル。 :attr:`x`と同じ形状である必要があります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:22
msgid ""
"The dimension or dimensions along which to compute the slope. If empty "
"tuple (default), computes slope over all elements."
msgstr "傾きを計算する次元または次元を指定します。空のタプル（デフォルト値）の場合、すべての要素にわたって傾きを計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:26
msgid ""
"Whether the output tensor retains the specified dimensions. Default is "
"False."
msgstr "出力テンソルが指定された次元を保持するかどうか。デフォルトは False。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.slope.rst
#, fuzzy
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:30
msgid ""
"The slope coefficients. If :attr:`keepdim` is True, the output tensor has"
" the same number of dimensions as the input with the reduced dimensions "
"having size 1."
msgstr "傾き係数。 :attr:`keepdim` が True の場合、出力テンソルは入力テンソルと同じ数の次元を持ち、削減された次元のサイズは 1 になります。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.slope.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:36
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:88
msgid ":func:`correl`: Pearson correlation coefficient."
msgstr ":func:`correl`: ピアソン相関係数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:89
msgid ":func:`covar`: Covariance between tensors."
msgstr ":func:`covar`: テンソル間の共分散を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:90
msgid ":func:`mulmean`: Multiplicative mean used in slope calculation."
msgstr ":func:`mulmean`: 傾き計算で使用される乗法的平均。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:93
msgid ""
"The slope calculation assumes a linear relationship between variables and"
" can be sensitive to outliers. For non-linear relationships, consider "
"polynomial regression or robust regression methods."
msgstr "この傾き計算は変数間に線形関係があることを前提としており、外れ値の影響を受けやすい特性があります。非線形関係を分析する場合は、多項式回帰や頑健な回帰手法の採用を検討してください。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:98
msgid ""
"Division by zero occurs when :attr:`x` has zero variance (all values are "
"identical). In such cases, the slope is undefined and will result in NaN "
"values. Consider preprocessing the data to handle constant variables "
"appropriately."
msgstr ":attr:`x`の分散が0の場合（すべての値が同一の場合）には、傾きは定義されず、NaN値となります。このような定数変数を適切に処理するためには、データ前処理段階で適切な処理を行うことを検討してください。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.slope.slope:104
msgid "References"
msgstr "参考文献"

